---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Lakshmi Trails">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <header class="legal-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
          
          <h3>1.1 Personal Information</h3>
          <p>When you interact with Lakshmi Trails LLC ("we," "our," or "us"), we may collect the following personal information:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, mailing address</li>
            <li><strong>Travel Information:</strong> Passport details, dietary restrictions, health considerations, emergency contacts</li>
            <li><strong>Booking Information:</strong> Travel preferences, accommodation requests, tour selections</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Billing address, payment method details (processed securely through third-party payment processors)</li>
            <li><strong>Communication Records:</strong> Email correspondence, phone call records, customer service interactions</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
          <p>We may automatically collect certain information when you visit our website:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>IP address, browser type, device information</li>
            <li>Pages visited, time spent on pages, referring websites</li>
            <li>Cookies and similar tracking technologies (see Cookie Policy below)</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use your personal information for the following purposes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> Planning, booking, and managing your travel experiences</li>
            <li><strong>Communication:</strong> Sending booking confirmations, travel updates, and customer service responses</li>
            <li><strong>Safety & Compliance:</strong> Ensuring traveler safety and meeting legal requirements</li>
            <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Sending newsletters and promotional content (with your consent)</li>
            <li><strong>Improvement:</strong> Analyzing usage to improve our services and website functionality</li>
            <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> Meeting regulatory requirements and protecting our legal rights</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Information Sharing</h2>
          <p>We may share your information with:</p>
          
          <h3>3.1 Service Providers</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Travel Partners:</strong> Hotels, tour operators, transportation providers, and local guides</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> Stripe, PayPal, and other secure payment platforms</li>
            <li><strong>Technology Providers:</strong> Website hosting, email services, customer support tools</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>3.2 Legal Requirements</h3>
          <p>We may disclose your information when required by law, court order, or to protect our rights and safety.</p>

          <h3>3.3 Business Transfers</h3>
          <p>In the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your information may be transferred to the new entity.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
          <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Secure data transmission using SSL/TLS encryption</li>
            <li>Regular security assessments and updates</li>
            <li>Limited access to personal information on a need-to-know basis</li>
            <li>Secure storage of sensitive information</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Important:</strong> While we strive to protect your information, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Provide our services and fulfill contractual obligations</li>
            <li>Comply with legal requirements (typically 7 years for financial records)</li>
            <li>Resolve disputes and enforce our agreements</li>
            <li>Improve our services through data analysis</li>
          </ul>
          <p>You may request deletion of your personal information, subject to legal and business requirements.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
            <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</li>
            <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information</li>
            <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request transfer of your data to another service provider</li>
            <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to processing of your personal information for marketing purposes</li>
            <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> Request restriction of processing under certain circumstances</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@lakshmitrails.com">info@lakshmitrails.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
          <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Remember your preferences and settings</li>
            <li>Analyze website traffic and usage patterns</li>
            <li>Provide personalized content and recommendations</li>
            <li>Enable social media features</li>
          </ul>
          <p>You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences. Disabling cookies may affect website functionality.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites or integrate with third-party services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external services. We recommend reviewing their privacy policies before providing personal information.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. International Data Transfers</h2>
          <p>As we provide travel services to India and other international destinations, your personal information may be transferred to and processed in countries outside your residence. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for such transfers.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Our services are not intended for individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If we become aware that we have collected such information, we will take steps to delete it promptly.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. We will notify you of significant changes by:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Posting the updated policy on our website</li>
            <li>Sending email notification to registered users</li>
            <li>Updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this policy</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>12. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>For questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact:</p>
          <div class="contact-info">
            <p><strong>Lakshmi Trails LLC</strong></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@lakshmitrails.com">info@lakshmitrails.com</a></p>
            <p>Phone: +1 347 414 6099</p>
            <p>Address: [BUSINESS_ADDRESS_PLACEHOLDER]</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-footer">
        <p><a href="/">← Back to Home</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-top: 100px;
    background: var(--color-mist);
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .legal-content {
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-stone);
  }

  .legal-content section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
  }

  .legal-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-stone);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content strong {
    color: var(--color-stone);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-info {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .contact-info p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .legal-footer a {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .legal-footer a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-page {
      padding-top: 80px;
    }

    .legal-container {
      margin: 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>